      "approximation_limit_3D: polygonal approximation convergence",
      "lipschitz_3D: Lipschitz stability with constant 1/(2d)",
      "smooth3D_lt_smooth2D: dimension comparison L/(2d) < 2L/(pid)",
      "smooth_crossing_ratio: 2D/3D ratio = 4/pi",
      "smooth3D_mono/strictMono: monotonicity theorems",
      "helix_expected_crossings: concrete example",
